stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : seat free, row inserted or reused
    [*] --> Failed : class full, row inserted (failureReason "Class full")
    Pending --> Confirmed : same transaction, after the capacity check
    Confirmed --> Cancelled : member cancels before the class starts, or the gym deactivates the class or account
    Confirmed --> Completed : coach or admin marks attended, once the date has arrived (Johannesburg)
    Confirmed --> NoShow : coach or admin marks no-show, once the date has arrived
    Completed --> NoShow : correction
    NoShow --> Completed : correction
    Cancelled --> Pending : member books the same class and date again (row reused)
    Failed --> Pending : a place has freed up and the member tries again (row reused)
    Failed --> Failed : still full (row updated)
    Cancelled --> Failed : booked again while the class is full (row updated)
    Completed --> [*]
    NoShow --> [*]
